 "text": "Perry County, Ohio | Auditor\nSkip to Content Skip to navigation\nPerry County, Ohio\nToggle navigation\nServices +\n911\nAuditor\nBoard of Developmental Disabilities\nBoard of Elections\nBureau of Motor Vehicles\nCommissioners\nCoroner\nDistrict Library\nDog Shelter\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nFairview Assisted Living\nHealth Department\nJob & Family Services\nLand Bank\nMobility Management\nOSU Extension Office\nPark District\nSenior Center\nSoil & Water Conservation\nTourism & Lodging Tax\nTransit\nTreasurer\nVeterans Services Commission\nWaste Reduction & Recycling\nWater & Wastewater\nRecords +\nPublic Notices\nClerk of Courts\nRecorder\nTitle Office\nLaw & Courts +\nCommon Pleas\nMunicipal Court\nProbate & Juvenile\nProsecutor\nSheriff’s Office\nPeople +\nDirectory\nJob Opportunities\nHuman Resources\nEvents\nHome About News\nNow: 1792338895 - October 18, 2026, 15:54:55 (GMT)\nStart: 1766725200 - December 26, 2025, 05:00:00 (GMT)\nEnd: 1792338895 - October 18, 2026, 15:54:55 (GMT)\nAuditor\nI want to...\nPay My Water Bill\nPurchase / Renew a Dog License\nGet / Renew a Driver’s License\nContact Children Services\nContact My Commissioners\nReport a Crime\nI need a record...\nVehicle, Boat Titles\nTax Records\nProperty Records\nCourt Records\nCrime Incident Records\nI need assistance...\nPublic Safety Issue\nChild Safety Situation\nElderly Safety Situation\nFood or Housing\nSubstance or Addiction Issues\nAgricultural Issues\nTax Issues\nAUDITOR\nDerek Householder\nOFFICE LOCATION\n212 S. Main Street\nNew Lexington, Ohio 43764\nHOURS OF OPERATION\nMonday – Friday\n8:00 am – 4:00 pm\nOffice Phone: (740) 342-2074\nFax: (740) 342-1627\nVisit Website\nSEND EMAIL\nPERRY COUNTY AUDITOR\nThe Perry County Auditor watches over all county funds and maintains the official records of all receipts, disbursements and fund balances. The County Auditor is the bookkeeper for all county elected officials and many other county agencies such as Human Services and Children Services.\nFrequently Asked Questions\nWhat is available at the Perry County Auditor’s website?\nPurchase and Renew Dog Tags online\nForms to apply for and information about valuing Perry County land for Current Agricultural Use (CAUV)\nSearchable property records including ownership, sales transactions and tax records\nFind a list of County and State Road numbers associated with Perry County roads (Example: Buckeye Valley Road is CR 5 (County Road 5)\nEstimate your property taxes using the online Tax Calculator\nView an annual list of Tax Rates\nFind general information about tax questions\nGo to the Auditor’s website\nPerry County, Ohio\nAbout\nVillages, Townships & Communities\nDiscover Perry County\nPerry County Photos\nRecords\nClerk of Courts\nRecorder\nTitle Office\nNews\nEvents\nFair Housing Information\nDepartments & Offices\n911\nAuditor\nBoard of Developmental Disabilities\nBoard of Elections\nBureau of Motor Vehicles\nCommissioners\nCoroner\nDog Shelter\nEmergency Management\nEngineer\nFairview Assisted Living\nHealth Department\nJob & Family Services\nLand Bank\nPark District\nMobility Management\nOSU Extension\nSenior Center\nSoil & Water Conservation\nTourism\nTransit\nTreasurer\nVeterans Services Commission\nWaste & Recycling\nWater & Wastewater\nLaw & Courts\nCommon Pleas\nJuvenile/Probate\nMulti-County Juvenile Facility\nMunicipal\nProsecutor\nSheriff\nPeople\nDirectory\nJob Opportunities\nHuman Resources\n212 S. Main Street, New Lexington, OH 43764 • (740) 342-2045\n© Copyright 2026 Perry County, All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy • Website Accessibility Statement • Site Map",
